Guardian's Light is an advanced deikhan technique that channels divine
favor through the warrior's shield. When wielding a shield in combat, a
trained deikhan may receive sudden bursts of divine protection at critical
moments.

This passive skill triggers automatically during combat when the deikhan
is using a shield. The deity watches over their faithful servant and
occasionally intervenes to deflect blows that would otherwise strike true.
Higher skill levels increase both the frequency and potency of this
divine intervention.

Guardian's Light represents the deikhan's deep connection to their deity
and their role as a holy defender. It complements other protective abilities
and makes shield-bearing deikhans exceptionally durable in combat.

Class: Deikhan
Discipline: Guardian

